sentences.text:
By this writ petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of India, the petitioner has put forth the following reliefs:
"B. To quash and set aside the award dated 18.02.1997 passed by the Special Land Acquisition officer, Aurangabad (Exhibit 'D') to the extent of acquisition land in Gut No.171 to the extent of 23 R of village Tisgaon, Tq. & Dist. Aurangabad by issuing appropriate writ or direction or order in the nature of writ as the case may be;
2 912 WP 10489-25 C.

